{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01895","headline":"杂曲歌辞 独不见 · 李白","name":"杂曲歌辞 独不见","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白马谁家子，黄龙边塞儿。\n天山三丈雪，岂是远行时。\n春蕙忽秋草，莎鸡鸣曲池。\n风催寒椶响，月入霜闺悲。\n忆与君别年，种桃齐蛾眉。\n桃今百余尺，花落成枯枝。\n终然独不见，流泪空自知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01895.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01895","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}